                                "sense_id": "5fcef9c1-a22f-3d1a-8d70-08a126dd033a",
                                "text": "Some were leaning against the window-frame with their barristerial feet up on the sill, others talking to short wiry monastic-looking men, the whole of which represented an eminent counsel receiving \"instructions\" from a local agent."
