                                "sense_id": "5fcef9c1-a22f-3d1a-8d70-08a126dd033a",
                                "text": "This rush for finer barristerial plumage accompanies the rekindling monarchist sentiment under the Abbott government, which gives the cringeworthy impression that Australia is still a branch of little England, full of 10 pound poms and God Save the Queen."
